---

<Layout
  title="About | Mentor AI"
  description="Learn more about the people behind Mentor AI."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" role="main" class="bg-background flex-1">
    <section
      class="mx-auto max-w-none px-6 pt-12 pb-24 md:px-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-40 lg:max-w-6xl"
    >
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl py-24 text-center sm:py-32 lg:py-48">
        <ScrollReveal>
          <h1
            class="text-umich-blue text-5xl leading-none font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-7xl"
          >
            We’re changing how feedback works in education
          </h1>
        </ScrollReveal>
        <ScrollReveal delay={0.1}>
          <p
            class="mt-8 text-lg font-medium text-pretty text-gray-700 sm:text-xl sm:leading-8"
          >
            We envision a future where every student receives meaningful,
            high-quality feedback on their writing, tailored to their individual
            needs while remaining aligned with course rubrics and expectations,
            without increasing the burden on instructors.
          </p>
        </ScrollReveal>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
        <ScrollReveal delay={0.2}>
          <h2
            class="text-umich-blue text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Our Mission
          </h2>
        </ScrollReveal>
        <ScrollReveal delay={0.3}>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg/8">
            Providing detailed, personalized feedback is challenging in large
            writing-intensive courses. In a randomized controlled trial with 354
            undergraduate students, AI-mediated feedback led to significantly
            higher-quality revisions. Our mission is to translate these research
            findings into practical tools that help instructors and TAs deliver
            consistent, high-quality feedback, while enabling every student to
            receive personalized guidance aligned with course rubrics.
          </p>
        </ScrollReveal>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
        <ScrollReveal delay={0.4}>
          <h1
            class="text-umich-blue text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Our Team
          </h1>
        </ScrollReveal>
        <ScrollReveal delay={0.5}>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg/8">
            Meet our interdisciplinary research team working on scalable
            AI-assisted feedback ecosystems for higher education, empowering
            instructors to scale personalized support and improve student
            learning outcomes on open-ended assignments.
          </p>
        </ScrollReveal>
      </div>
      <ScrollReveal delay={0.6}>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
          <h3
            class="text-umich-blue text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl"
          >
            Faculty
          </h3>
        </div>
      </ScrollReveal>
      <ScrollReveal delay={0.7}>
        <ul
          role="list"
          class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-16 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3"
        >
          {
            faculty.map((member) => (
              <li>
                <TeamMemberCard {...member} />
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>
      <ScrollReveal delay={0.8}>
        <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
          <h3
            class="text-umich-blue text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl"
          >
            Research Team
          </h3>
        </div>
      </ScrollReveal>
      <ScrollReveal delay={0.9}>
        <ul
          role="list"
          class="mx-auto mt-8 grid max-w-2xl grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3"
        >
          {
            researchers.map((member) => (
              <li>
                <TeamMemberCard {...member} />
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </ScrollReveal>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
        <ScrollReveal delay={1.0}>
          <h2
            class="text-umich-blue text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Join the Mentor AI Team!
          </h2>
        </ScrollReveal>
        <ScrollReveal delay={1.1}>
          <p class="my-6">
            Want to contribute to our mission? Sign up to become part of our
            research team.
          </p>
          <a
            href={`${BASE_URL}signup/`}
            class="bg-umich-blue hover:ring-umich-blue focus-visible:ring-umich-blue hover:text-umich-blue focus-visible:text-umich-blue rounded-md px-3 py-2 leading-none text-white transition hover:bg-white hover:ring-2 focus:outline-none focus-visible:bg-white focus-visible:ring-2"
          >
            Join us!
          </a>
        </ScrollReveal>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
